Origin
------

This work is based on Juggluco by Jaap Korthals Altes:

  Website: https://www.juggluco.nl
  Source:  https://github.com/j-kaltes/Juggluco

Juggluco's sensor-communication core (the native engine and its Libre 2/3 BLE
and NFC paths) is retained; the phone UI and the WearOS app are rebuilt.


Changes from upstream (2026)
----------------------------

In accordance with section 5 of the GNU General Public License v3, this is a
modified version of Juggluco. The significant changes made in this fork are:

  * A new Jetpack Compose, Material 3 phone UI replacing the legacy UI
    (modules: app, shared).
  * A new WearOS companion app with live value, graph, tile, complications,
    on-watch alarms, and phone<->watch sensor hand-off (module: wear).
  * The Juggluco engine glue extracted into a reusable :core module; several
    engine-facing classes reimplemented against it (module: core).
  * Reworked background readings and alarm handling.

Files carry per-file notices indicating their origin:

  * Files retaining Juggluco's original code carry Jaap Korthals Altes's
    copyright notice, plus a "Modified 2026 by Joshua Meyer" banner where this
    fork changed them.
  * Files reimplementing a Juggluco class carry Joshua Meyer's copyright with a
    "Portions derived from Juggluco" acknowledgment.
  * Wholly new files carry Joshua Meyer's copyright.


